  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nationel Expert - EFSD/EIP DEVCO C3 Investment and Innovative Financing - Nationel Expert - EFSD/EIP DEVCO C3 - JB</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert - L&#xe5;n och Garantier EFSD/EIP DEVCO C3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Expert till EFSD/EIP DEVCO C3 Investment and Innovative Financing  contribute to the preparation, assessment and implementation of financial instruments (in particular the EFSD guarantee), in close cooperation with international financial institutions.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert till EFSD/EIP DEVCO C3 bidra till beredning, bed&#xf6;mning och genomf&#xf6;rande av finansiella instrument (s&#xe4;rskilt EFSD garantin), i n&#xe4;ra samarbete med internationella finansieringsinstitut.</narrative>
  </description>
